    # For diamond: top (y,x), right (y+(size-1), x+(size-1)//2), bottom, left
    # Actually, diamond spans with size (radius from center), corner to corner

    # Diamond center is at (y + size//2, x + size//2)
    # Corners extend size-1 from center
    center_y = y + size // 2
    center_x = x + size // 2

    # Diamond occupies cells where distance from center in diamond metric <= size//2
